{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipping Phantom is a 2D pixel-art, puzzle-platformer with <i>no dedicated jump button</i>. Master the timing of your gravity-inversion and float abilities to navigate through a myriad of maze-like levels while avoiding contact with other-worldly obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/2b4c909c1fcdc42a037101013ddd1d50.poster.avif?t=1754074903\" aria-label=\"The basic Gravity Inversion mechanic in Flipping Phantom\" width=960 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/2b4c909c1fcdc42a037101013ddd1d50.webm?t=1754074903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/extras/2b4c909c1fcdc42a037101013ddd1d50.mp4?t=1754074903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through distinct worlds that introduce new environmental mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pumpkins and unlock bonus levels for an added challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic clues and uncover secrets to help reunite the ghost with all their spooky friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule art by Paul T-B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music - Emerald Therapy by Audionautix is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 license</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866090?t=1754074903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866090/0cd2f74559ef1c3d0b587ce9f8ea7709ea196ca2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754074903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat